  "details": "Current Expression Menu on wings doesn't have any of the following functions\n\n- Release Poses\n\n- Avatar Scaling options\n\n- Legacy Fingers\n\nThe Reset Avatar button on wings should be replaced to 'Quick Actions' for a sake of consistency and accessibility. \n\nThis would also solve accidental hit of Reset Avatar due to the layout. It's been annoying me for long, but I guess here's the solution.\n\nSimilar feedback from the past:\n\n\"[1236]\"Release Poses\" is missing from Wing Menu Expressions.\"\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1236release-poses-is-missing-from-wing-menu-expressions",
